  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/706",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">시작은 &lt;과학티셔츠&gt; <br>하나 사보까 였습니다;;;<br><br>그러다 &lt;알리&gt;에 빠져들게 되더니<br>개미지옥이 따로 없네요. <br><br>음... 외국 쇼핑몰이라 <br>좀 조심스럽긴 합니다만<br>결국 국내 오픈마켓도 <br>여기 물건을 가져오는 곳이 많... <br><br>같은 물건을 포털에서 검색하면<br>좀 어이없는 가격으로 파네요;;<br><br>&lt;알리&gt;에 이런 것도 있구나...<br>정보 공유차원에서 올려봅니다. <br>아이쇼핑하셔요. ^^<br><br>1. 달 빔</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44804a0b3c3c7f2732409349ae691b39ec43777e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44804a0b3c3c7f2732409349ae691b39ec43777e\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"977\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">달 모양을 아주 싸구려 빔으로 팔길래<br>속는 셈치고 사봤는데<br>3천원치고는 훌륭한 제품이긴 합니다. <br>어릴 때 눈에 대고 영화관 보는 그런 장난감 느낌이여요. <br><br>다른 필름을 끼우면 딴 행성으로 바뀝니다. <br><br>불다끄고 칠판에 쏘면 달표면. 달 크기. 뭐든 좋습니다. </p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>2. 과학 뱃지</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a0953011575c9dcfc08c0789756a014b551c04d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a0953011575c9dcfc08c0789756a014b551c04d\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"856\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">국내에도 이런 과학관련 굿즈 판매처가 많이 생기길<br><br>You all need science. 라니 ㅠ ㅠ<br>너무 이쁘고 내용도 좋아서<br>과학덕후 양산에 좋은 상품이예요. <br><br>국내 포털에도 수입해서 <br>좀 더 비싸게 파는 곳이 많아서<br>과학 행사 이벤트 상품으로 추천!<br><br>3. 과학 교사 열쇠고리</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3bfd6ba01393a240e987ff41e7a5cad56ce42bf1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3bfd6ba01393a240e987ff41e7a5cad56ce42bf1\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"969\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">가장 많이 산 제품이구요 ㅋ<br>색상마다 모두 느낌이 달라서 <br>구리. 알미늄 ㅋㅋ 같...<br>과학쌤들 선물드리기 좋아요. <br>가격대비 퀄이 괜찮거든요. <br><br>4. 과학교사 티셔츠</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1139e470b32f9ad4b3d6bcd1b5b486c86677f7e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1139e470b32f9ad4b3d6bcd1b5b486c86677f7e\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"961\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81cf13cf81421dea0d9754f0fb6296bc32bbcf0c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81cf13cf81421dea0d9754f0fb6296bc32bbcf0c\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"993\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f9f41fdc2421a67e5ebe41bae9c00ab3a473cd4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f9f41fdc2421a67e5ebe41bae9c00ab3a473cd4\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"974\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">주기율표 수업때 입고가면<br>애들이 좋아합니다 ㅋ<br><br>국내에 과학 유투버 채널인 &lt;안될과학&gt;에서 이벤트로 주기율표 티만든 것도 가지고 있는데요. 네이버 검색어 &lt;주기율표 티셔츠&gt;<br><br>이벤트 끝나고도  국내 어느 업체에서 받아서 계속 판매하더라구요. <br>걔는 면이 꽤 괜찮은 편이고<br><br>알리서 1만원대에 산건 대충 천도 저렴한 애들이 대부분이였습니다. <br>다...당연한 소리를;; ㅋ<br><br>5. 수업때 티셔츠들들들<br><br>그럼 기타등등의 수업과 관련된 티셔츠들을 보여드릴께요. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d657b7376c1d42157684b584f9abe4f00fdf23c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d657b7376c1d42157684b584f9abe4f00fdf23c\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"977\"><div class=\"figcaption\">중3. 위치에너지가 딱 ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1690b3ce8db22485f3f6f73d154d1eed81aa947e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1690b3ce8db22485f3f6f73d154d1eed81aa947e\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"983\"><div class=\"figcaption\">중2. 원소기호!!</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e8f6727ba4fa65e15f205d20e8efd8a77a410a9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e8f6727ba4fa65e15f205d20e8efd8a77a410a9\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"977\"><div class=\"figcaption\">중3. 포화수증기압 때. 물과 공기사이 굳</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a66311e51131682061a00106462c3beaa573f9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a66311e51131682061a00106462c3beaa573f9e\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"980\"><div class=\"figcaption\">이런거 너무 사랑하죠. 역단층보고 not my fault라니 어찌 아니 빠지겠습니까</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7e1c3b37f94e2d42eb159152d19374b90ea7b98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7e1c3b37f94e2d42eb159152d19374b90ea7b98\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"970\"><div class=\"figcaption\">고등 지학은 되어야 알아볼 수 있겠죠잉</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee325c9075a6b0d939c7bcb27a56360ee4f4868f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee325c9075a6b0d939c7bcb27a56360ee4f4868f\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"967\"><div class=\"figcaption\">공중제비하며 봐도 현미경ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89dc39dfc90f509267e95864a6503868b524d8a0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89dc39dfc90f509267e95864a6503868b524d8a0\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"987\"><div class=\"figcaption\">중2 심장 &#10084;&#65039; </div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebc753c8748c3bc43b1b1b09807c6445fa30c54c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebc753c8748c3bc43b1b1b09807c6445fa30c54c\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"985\"><div class=\"figcaption\">ㅋ 물리쌤들 ㅋ 어떠신가요</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc20c16d8d509c1cc909186a3e1a8506eb995a83\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc20c16d8d509c1cc909186a3e1a8506eb995a83\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"963\"><div class=\"figcaption\">차마 용기나진 않지만 ㅋ 소화계 ㅋ</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/656e02b210321f4f3a5807ea89dae5047cd45b04\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/656e02b210321f4f3a5807ea89dae5047cd45b04\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"997\"><div class=\"figcaption\">넘나 사랑하는 드라마. 그레이 아나토미의 주인공들 이름이 딱!</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>6. 그외 각종 덕후품들<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51ad9737f91a5ceebdd8acdcb9c6cdfd26dd3334\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51ad9737f91a5ceebdd8acdcb9c6cdfd26dd3334\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"830\"><div class=\"figcaption\">음 ㅋ 얘도 난이도는 좀 있지만 ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1656614180e15d65e35ac788a99e4301becc6423\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1656614180e15d65e35ac788a99e4301becc6423\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"972\"><div class=\"figcaption\">과학도우미들 행사용품으로 나름ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc35c3f04f504c71d1e51211d132685d7f4b464a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc35c3f04f504c71d1e51211d132685d7f4b464a\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"990\"><div class=\"figcaption\">ㅋ 분필보관함?? ㅎㅎ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82206976d389de355631ff96446b7d2d7136567c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82206976d389de355631ff96446b7d2d7136567c\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"980\"><div class=\"figcaption\">디자인이 좀 아쉽지만 ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bab55644f2189ab691b08c94aa53d4689890d1f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bab55644f2189ab691b08c94aa53d4689890d1f\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"947\"><div class=\"figcaption\">먹으면 배아플것 같..ㅋ</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/370477f27f9b9ed09206812777874471d48cf3fd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/370477f27f9b9ed09206812777874471d48cf3fd\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"976\"><div class=\"figcaption\">멘트 넘 사랑스럽네요</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd4f721ec9de787bb2708ab9fcefe088243400e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd4f721ec9de787bb2708ab9fcefe088243400e5\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"966\"><div class=\"figcaption\">얘는 막 고퀄은 아닙니다. 사진이 잘나온 편. </div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>7. 지금 오는 중</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/447e75af0939051eda927dd236cee378d19e5698\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/447e75af0939051eda927dd236cee378d19e5698\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"971\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">화성에서 보낸 탐사선 드론이 <br>2중 날개를 사용해 뜬다지요. <br><br>부족한 대기로 인해 충분한 양력을 만들기 위한 아이디어라는데 <br><br>이렇게 장난감에 응용이 되네요. 와~<br><br>손을 대면 위로 도망간다고 하고 <br>한국인 후기가 가성비 훌륭한 어른 장난감이라 하더라구요. <br><br>화성 수업할 때  &lt;어쩌다어른 문경수&gt;편에서 같이 보여주면 좋을 것 같아요. <br><br>요건 최근 5일 배송 상품입니당. <br><br><br>석가탄신일을 기다리는 밤입니다. <br>&#128525;&#128077;<br><br><br>아. 알리는 &lt;5일배송&gt; 상품아니면<br>시킨 걸 까먹어야 받을 수 있...답니다. <br>특히 여름옷은 여름에 못받을 수도 ㅠ ㅠ <br>배송이 참...;;;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
